{"id":404320703,"chapter_id":50088,"scene_id":58875,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"現時点ではマロウが敵か味方か断定できない。慎重を期すなら、彼に銃を持たせるわけにはいかない。","style":3,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"マロウ","content":"何をするつもりだ！？早く銃をよこせ！さもなければ——","voice":["vo_event_404320703_01"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43207","style":1,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"（パンパンという銃声の効果音）","style":18,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"マロウ","content":"くそ野郎が……","voice":["vo_event_404320703_03"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43207","style":1,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"マロウが倒れた後、激しい足音がこの部屋に向かって押し寄せてきた。","style":3,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"護衛A","content":"ぐずぐず何やってんだ。まだ仕留めていなかったのか？","voice":["vo_event_404320703_05"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43207","style":1,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"護衛B","content":"奴らを生かして出すな、やれ！！","voice":["vo_event_404320703_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43207","style":1,"background":2506,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"（銃声の効果音＋赤い画面）","style":18,"background":2506,"log_type":1}]}